WEBVTT

00:05.260 --> 00:06.110
Why, you...

00:10.990 --> 00:13.990
Stay put for now.

00:28.930 --> 00:34.310
ARIFURETA - FROM COMMONPLACE
TO WORLD'S STRONGEST SEASON 3

01:46.000 --> 01:51.010
THANK GOD SHE'S STILL A PERVERT!

01:54.540 --> 01:56.840
Don't spit it out.
Drink like you depend on it.

02:02.360 --> 02:04.100
Is it really you, Nagumo?

02:04.100 --> 02:06.020
What else do you see me as?

02:07.080 --> 02:08.380
But how...

02:08.380 --> 02:09.390
Calm down.

02:09.800 --> 02:13.580
I just ended up here after passing
through the emerging path.

02:13.580 --> 02:15.370
So...

02:16.210 --> 02:18.440
You really saved me...

02:28.360 --> 02:30.800
Hey, you've recovered fully now, right?

02:30.800 --> 02:32.170
Time for a revenge match.

02:32.170 --> 02:33.670
Get her good this time.

02:35.100 --> 02:37.760
But I can't win against that...

02:38.810 --> 02:39.970
So...

02:44.040 --> 02:46.100
Fear not, Yaegashi.

02:47.230 --> 02:49.010
Take it now.

02:49.010 --> 02:51.400
For your own safety and well-being.

02:52.120 --> 02:53.310
Nagumo...

02:55.740 --> 02:58.120
Here's Pink Mask Mk. II.

02:58.120 --> 03:01.350
Nagumo, this is no time for jokes!

03:01.350 --> 03:04.040
How rude.
I'm not jesting here.

03:04.430 --> 03:09.170
The evolution brought by evolution magic
doesn't exclude your pink mask.

03:10.320 --> 03:12.050
Time to be surprised.

03:12.330 --> 03:16.050
Just by putting this on,
you'll have thrice the perception.

03:16.310 --> 03:18.330
You can win against her with this.

03:20.020 --> 03:22.560
That's needlessly high-performance...

03:22.850 --> 03:24.730
Starting to crave it, right?

03:24.730 --> 03:29.060
Sure, you're most suitable
for this pink mask...

03:29.060 --> 03:29.960
I shall admit that...

03:29.960 --> 03:31.240
I don't need it!

03:31.240 --> 03:33.360
I can win with my own skills!

03:33.360 --> 03:37.320
Besides, if I have to wear it,
I'd rather struggle to the death!

03:37.320 --> 03:39.660
Right. You can win this.

03:39.660 --> 03:41.370
Even without this thing.

03:42.760 --> 03:43.870
Don't forget.

03:44.200 --> 03:46.930
That is surely your other side,

03:46.930 --> 03:48.070
but not your everything.

03:49.250 --> 03:52.740
It's merely a fragment of you,
made of negative emotions.

03:53.440 --> 03:56.380
The most important emotion
is right in front of me.

03:56.640 --> 03:59.000
You, Shizuku Yaegashi,
should have it in you.

03:59.000 --> 04:00.020
Right?

04:00.020 --> 04:02.390
I have it in me...

04:02.680 --> 04:05.090
If her words can make you feel down,

04:05.090 --> 04:07.700
that's also proof that
you're embracing yourself.

04:08.080 --> 04:10.430
A good-for-nothing
would only turn upon it.

04:11.180 --> 04:14.400
Still, you're just a tad too serious.

04:14.740 --> 04:16.180
Try to relax a bit, will you?

04:17.260 --> 04:18.560
Nagumo...

04:19.800 --> 04:22.910
By the way,
I'm one of the good-for-nothing bunch.

04:23.850 --> 04:25.200
I'll watch over you.

04:25.890 --> 04:27.960
Keep trying until you win.

04:27.960 --> 04:30.180
As long as I'm here, you won't die.

04:31.010 --> 04:32.800
I won't let that happen.

04:33.330 --> 04:34.390
You'll be fine.

04:37.440 --> 04:39.250
Such killing words...

04:40.460 --> 04:42.970
So you'll watch over me, right?

04:42.970 --> 04:43.970
Yeah.

04:44.560 --> 04:46.950
You'll protect me
when I need you, right?

04:46.950 --> 04:47.980
Sure.

04:48.410 --> 04:52.150
Even if my heart breaks,
would you get me back up again?

04:52.150 --> 04:53.590
I suppose I have to.

04:55.160 --> 04:56.360
I'm off, then.

04:56.360 --> 04:58.120
Go for it.

05:00.760 --> 05:03.990
The nerve to flirt before your enemy, huh?

05:04.440 --> 05:06.510
Quite a composed look you have there.

05:07.300 --> 05:09.910
You think so?
It's all thanks to Nagumo.

05:10.200 --> 05:11.380
Oh, my.

05:11.380 --> 05:13.680
So you're really betraying your best friend?

05:14.130 --> 05:15.800
And your rival in love too...

05:16.160 --> 05:18.120
Let's not have pointless talks.

05:18.120 --> 05:20.330
No use wondering to oneself.

05:20.790 --> 05:23.830
I'll live and go see
Kaori and the others again.

05:24.470 --> 05:25.840
Anything else is after that.

05:27.650 --> 05:30.510
I'll haul in all that's best for me.

05:30.880 --> 05:32.330
I won't give up.

05:32.940 --> 05:36.650
In the end,
you've become a fighting woman.

05:37.260 --> 05:38.300
You're right.

05:38.660 --> 05:41.630
I've killed many and survived.

05:41.630 --> 05:44.280
But as a result, I've gained a lot.

05:44.700 --> 05:47.450
So much and so dear that
I can't throw away any of it.

05:48.220 --> 05:53.210
Even for a fighting woman, I seem to have
someone stronger than me protecting me.

05:53.650 --> 05:56.920
"She's only someone dear to Kaori."

05:56.920 --> 05:59.150
That's probably
the indirect reason for him.

05:59.150 --> 06:00.720
That's for sure.

06:00.720 --> 06:03.740
I don't mind that, for now.

06:04.500 --> 06:06.700
I will put everything in this one strike.

06:06.700 --> 06:09.200
Try to dodge it if you can.

06:11.320 --> 06:13.140
Such amazing spirit.

06:13.140 --> 06:16.230
You really came in at great timing.

06:16.680 --> 06:20.480
Someone who appears
at the right place, at the right time.

06:20.480 --> 06:24.510
I thought something like this
only existed in fiction.

06:56.310 --> 06:57.580
Well done.

06:57.580 --> 07:00.320
I'd fall for your swordsmanship anytime.

07:04.440 --> 07:06.630
Feel free to fall for me now.

07:07.160 --> 07:08.880
What are you saying?

07:08.880 --> 07:10.210
Oh, too bad, then.

07:13.170 --> 07:16.000
Yaegashi, can't you walk?

07:16.000 --> 07:17.280
I don't think so...

07:18.600 --> 07:21.110
With that being said,
I'm in your care now.

07:21.110 --> 07:22.130
Huh?

07:22.640 --> 07:24.130
Carry me in your arms.

07:24.130 --> 07:27.930
Yaegashi, haven't you changed now?

07:27.930 --> 07:32.180
You don't hold back,
and you've become cheeky...

07:33.680 --> 07:36.260
I just thought I should
be more honest with myself.

07:36.650 --> 07:41.330
Oh, right. Could you make me
an artifact with regeneration magic?

07:41.940 --> 07:44.400
Mind making it into
a hair ornament, too?

07:44.990 --> 07:47.910
I mean, my old one got cut apart.

07:48.310 --> 07:49.860
I prefer if it's cute.

07:49.860 --> 07:52.020
That's a lot of requests...

07:53.540 --> 07:57.210
Seems like a lot's off your chest now.

07:58.300 --> 07:59.340
So pretty.

07:59.720 --> 08:01.720
This should do, right?

08:08.600 --> 08:09.680
What do you think?

08:10.140 --> 08:13.740
It doesn't hold a candle to
the actual regeneration magic,

08:13.740 --> 08:17.450
but it should work flawlessly
to regenerate your body.

08:18.220 --> 08:20.390
That's not what I want to hear.

08:20.810 --> 08:22.420
Come on, let's go.

08:24.040 --> 08:26.520
I wish you'd carry me like a princess.

08:27.390 --> 08:28.550
Oh, well.

08:30.600 --> 08:32.200
Hey, Nagumo.

08:32.200 --> 08:33.710
What?

08:34.190 --> 08:37.010
Did you hear
what my other self was saying?

08:37.630 --> 08:41.740
Nah, you were too far away,
and I could barely hear your voice.

08:41.740 --> 08:42.560
I see.

08:43.740 --> 08:46.380
Look. It's full of callouses, right?

08:46.380 --> 08:50.680
It's been like that, but it's got
even harder since we got to Tortus.

08:51.650 --> 08:55.000
Do you think this isn't
what a girl should have for a hand?

08:56.140 --> 09:00.230
If you consider a girl's
hand to be soft and spotless,

09:00.230 --> 09:02.050
then this sure isn't one.

09:04.030 --> 09:06.440
But I think it's a great hand.

09:06.440 --> 09:07.400
Really?

09:07.400 --> 09:08.260
Yeah.

09:08.680 --> 09:12.310
Compared to the hand of someone who can't
lift anything bigger than chopsticks,

09:12.310 --> 09:14.090
it's far prettier.

09:15.060 --> 09:16.120
Yaegashi?

09:17.430 --> 09:19.840
Thank you for saving me.

09:20.420 --> 09:21.540
I just happened to.

09:22.420 --> 09:25.940
Nagumo, I want to see Kaori now.

09:26.440 --> 09:29.000
Yue, Shea, and Tio too...

09:29.370 --> 09:30.420
And then.

09:31.290 --> 09:33.710
I'll tell them that I came to love you now.

09:33.710 --> 09:35.480
I don't know what'll happen, though.

09:35.900 --> 09:38.150
I'll be honest with myself
and face everything.

09:38.540 --> 09:41.150
I see. Means we gotta hurry...

09:41.150 --> 09:44.670
W-Wait, what did you just...

09:45.570 --> 09:47.580
Just you wait, Kaori.

09:48.190 --> 09:51.670
I'll go show you my selfish side now.

09:55.830 --> 09:57.450
Wow, what a dream.

09:58.420 --> 10:00.920
But why was I dreaming about Suzu?

10:00.920 --> 10:03.120
It's almost time to go.

10:05.080 --> 10:07.480
You came here to fetch me, Freid?

10:07.480 --> 10:09.210
My, so kind of you!

10:09.480 --> 10:11.740
Don't run off on your own again.

10:11.740 --> 10:12.970
You will obey me.

10:13.380 --> 10:16.410
It's rather difficult to bury you now.

10:16.410 --> 10:18.960
Okay, okay, I hear you.

10:18.960 --> 10:19.790
Come on.

10:28.550 --> 10:29.600
Suzu...

10:30.040 --> 10:34.130
Your weakness is that
you look away from reality.

10:36.130 --> 10:37.330
That...

10:37.730 --> 10:39.560
...is my weakness.

10:41.630 --> 10:43.130
Hallowed Ground!

10:51.510 --> 10:54.880
Always try to smile at any time.

10:54.880 --> 10:58.420
That way, we don't have to be alone, right?

10:59.050 --> 11:03.710
Hey, did you really think
smiling would solve anything?

11:04.560 --> 11:06.860
Having such shallow
and broad relationships,

11:06.860 --> 11:10.270
you never even let
anyone into your heart.

11:10.270 --> 11:12.840
Did you really think you weren't alone?

11:13.280 --> 11:16.920
Try to remember
what kind of person you are.

11:17.320 --> 11:19.830
And the great sin
you've caused as a result!

11:22.120 --> 11:24.240
It's been like that since the start, eh?

11:24.240 --> 11:28.080
Right, ever since you met her...

11:28.790 --> 11:34.110
You didn't think that
Eri was just a "quiet, nice girl".

11:34.110 --> 11:37.890
Yeah, you sympathised with her,
knowing you two were alike, eh?

11:37.890 --> 11:40.850
You sympathised with her
calculated and dramatic way of life!

11:49.860 --> 11:53.720
That's why you believed
Eri would do the same.

11:53.720 --> 11:56.470
That she'd sympathise with you.

11:57.430 --> 12:01.820
You didn't doubt her
as a true friend, best friend.

12:01.820 --> 12:04.450
That's what you wanted to believe.

12:04.770 --> 12:08.400
It was only you who noticed her true self.

12:08.400 --> 12:11.380
Only you could've stopped the tragedy.

12:12.150 --> 12:14.620
You should've interrogated Eri.

12:14.620 --> 12:17.300
You shouldn't have run away and faced her.

12:17.300 --> 12:20.180
Yet you looked away!

12:20.180 --> 12:23.930
From the unwanted truth
to protect your heart!

12:23.930 --> 12:27.020
From your best friend!
You looked away from it all!

12:39.730 --> 12:42.320
What do you plan
after seeing her again?

12:42.760 --> 12:46.560
You don't even know
what you want to say.

12:47.580 --> 12:50.660
Even after this much,
I don't get stronger.

12:50.660 --> 12:53.150
Or rather, my enhancement is wearing off...

12:53.610 --> 12:54.680
I knew it.

12:55.670 --> 12:58.450
That's gotta be the rule.

12:58.450 --> 13:01.590
In that case, you
won't get any stronger.

13:02.090 --> 13:03.140
I see.

13:03.600 --> 13:06.100
To think you didn't even argue about it...

13:06.770 --> 13:09.290
All to look at yourself
in the eye for real...

13:10.020 --> 13:12.700
All you said is true.

13:13.090 --> 13:15.130
I really am hopeless.

13:15.640 --> 13:19.520
But I'm done with standing
still for my own sake again.

13:20.520 --> 13:24.450
In the first place,
since I had that dream in Haltina,

13:24.450 --> 13:28.040
I already figured out
how many times I looked away...

13:28.040 --> 13:29.370
...from things precious to me.

13:29.370 --> 13:32.990
A world where you stopped Eri
and smiled together forever...

13:32.990 --> 13:34.810
Such a convenient dream.

13:34.810 --> 13:38.300
That dream world should be obtainable.

13:38.630 --> 13:41.720
Had I accepted reality for what it was.

13:42.140 --> 13:47.140
As you said, I don't really know
what I should do if I see Eri again.

13:47.570 --> 13:51.320
Do I want to blame her,
or apologise for looking away,

13:51.320 --> 13:53.060
or persuade her?

13:54.040 --> 13:55.130
I don't know.

13:55.860 --> 13:59.990
But, I do know that I must see her again!

14:00.400 --> 14:02.910
Looks like that's some
real determination you have.

14:02.910 --> 14:06.280
Yeah, I won't have
only sweet dreams.

14:06.280 --> 14:10.200
I'll overcome you and walk the path ahead!

14:10.200 --> 14:12.050
I accept your challenge.

14:12.050 --> 14:15.300
The power created from turning
your weakness into willpower...

14:15.300 --> 14:17.420
Show me how strong it is!

14:20.420 --> 14:22.640
Thank you, Miss Trial.

14:22.640 --> 14:23.760
Here I go!

14:23.760 --> 14:26.680
Become ten thousand flowers
and scatter with the light!

14:26.680 --> 14:28.320
Blossom Burst!

14:40.520 --> 14:43.980
I hope my feelings can reach her...

14:56.750 --> 14:58.610
Huh?

14:59.360 --> 15:01.720
Yo, Suzu. You're finally awake.

15:01.720 --> 15:04.030
Huh? Ryutarou?

15:04.030 --> 15:06.020
Yep, it's me.

15:06.020 --> 15:11.010
Could it be that the trial room
was connected with everyone else's?

15:11.010 --> 15:12.360
Seems like it.

15:12.360 --> 15:15.100
I think someone else
is just up ahead too.

15:15.100 --> 15:17.840
I hope it's Kaori or Miss Tio.

15:17.840 --> 15:21.400
By the way, how did your trial go?

15:21.400 --> 15:22.440
Me?

15:22.440 --> 15:24.490
You don't have to answer
if you don't want to.

15:24.490 --> 15:27.460
It wasn't anything big, so it's fine.

15:27.870 --> 15:31.490
He just called me a slob.

15:33.610 --> 15:35.960
That I was just fooling everyone.

15:35.960 --> 15:40.200
That I was okay with being second
or third best to Koki or Nagumo.

15:40.200 --> 15:41.840
Is that...

15:41.840 --> 15:46.340
I don't think I can win,
and I hate being embarrassed from losing,

15:46.630 --> 15:48.350
and I am too afraid to admit it...

15:49.360 --> 15:54.750
He told me a lot of stuff, including that
I'm just a supporting character in the end.

15:54.750 --> 15:56.480
You poor thing...

15:56.480 --> 15:58.400
Oh, shut it!

15:58.740 --> 16:00.410
Anything but that final blow!

16:04.650 --> 16:08.070
Have you not protected
the hopeless so much?

16:08.070 --> 16:11.580
Have you not supported
the weak so much?

16:11.580 --> 16:16.450
Have you not fought evil first
before anyone else?

16:19.960 --> 16:23.630
Right. Regardless of the nation or race,

16:23.630 --> 16:27.010
we dragonmen are the guardians of all.

16:27.370 --> 16:31.680
How many people do you
think we never saved that time?

16:31.680 --> 16:34.190
How many have not been in awe...

16:34.600 --> 16:36.770
...of the morality and goodness
we have set forth,

16:36.770 --> 16:40.190
and of our determination to be virtuous?!

16:43.370 --> 16:46.780
It was surely touted
as the strongest and best nation.

16:47.630 --> 16:49.770
It was supposed to be paradise.

16:49.770 --> 16:53.530
Regardless of strength,
race or social status,

16:53.530 --> 16:57.410
anyone could live together in harmony!

16:57.860 --> 16:59.140
Indeed.

17:07.380 --> 17:10.620
God and people turned it all...

17:10.620 --> 17:12.730
...back into ashes.

17:20.200 --> 17:21.810
I can feel it!

17:21.810 --> 17:26.110
Your hatred and indignation!
Your fear and resignation!

17:27.040 --> 17:30.790
You could never forget
that tragedy even after centuries.

17:30.790 --> 17:34.620
The betrayal of those you protected,
like flipping a hand!

17:34.970 --> 17:37.070
The insulting and awe-inspiring gaze...

17:37.070 --> 17:40.580
The humiliation after having
one's parents and friends murdered,

17:40.580 --> 17:44.000
and the disgrace brought from their corpses...

17:44.000 --> 17:49.170
Say, you must have
felt good back then, no?

17:49.560 --> 17:53.090
You know, when you blew
the church into smithereens.

17:53.940 --> 17:57.850
The centre of that great
assault was also the church.

17:57.850 --> 18:02.940
Was it not an inexpressible pleasure
to see your hated enemy shattered?

18:03.320 --> 18:07.000
You initially thought you
would go with Hajime Nagumo,

18:07.000 --> 18:10.530
because you would be
able to use him, right?

18:10.810 --> 18:14.450
If God bears His fangs,
so will Hajime Nagumo.

18:14.450 --> 18:18.730
That will surely be
the most pleasing revenge.

18:18.730 --> 18:21.290
Did you not think so?

18:22.750 --> 18:27.170
Humans, demi-humans,
demons, and God...

18:27.170 --> 18:30.920
You hate all those who robbed you
of your precious things.

18:30.920 --> 18:35.880
That hatred, that anger...
It is indeed your right to bear such emotions.

18:35.880 --> 18:39.600
Indeed, vengeance is your right to have!

18:39.600 --> 18:41.560
Take my hand!

18:41.560 --> 18:45.520
Then I shall accomplish that for you.

18:46.310 --> 18:50.920
No more tormented conscience
to blunt the fangs of vengeance.

18:50.920 --> 18:55.360
I shall lure Hajime Nagumo
for you to exact revenge.

18:55.680 --> 18:58.010
Miss Tio, don't listen to her!

18:58.010 --> 19:00.240
Go back to your usual self!

19:03.330 --> 19:06.520
We have yet to learn our
purpose in this world.

19:06.520 --> 19:09.720
Is this body man or beast?

19:10.210 --> 19:13.430
If all things were made with a purpose,

19:13.430 --> 19:15.180
then the answer must lie somewhere.

19:16.020 --> 19:17.590
Those words...

19:17.880 --> 19:21.050
For centuries we have been
unable to find the answer.

19:21.050 --> 19:25.520
In which case, it is time we decided
on an answer for ourselves.

19:26.390 --> 19:27.880
Such power...

19:27.880 --> 19:30.270
No way! What could be causing this?!

19:30.600 --> 19:33.490
A dragon’s eyes see the truth,

19:33.490 --> 19:35.700
piercing all lies and deceit.

19:36.030 --> 19:38.820
A dragon’s talons tear through fortresses,

19:38.820 --> 19:41.430
striking down the evil sequestered within.

19:41.430 --> 19:44.350
A dragon’s fangs shred
through one’s own weakness,

19:44.350 --> 19:46.960
biting through hatred and wrath.

19:47.250 --> 19:51.200
For once a dragon loses its benevolence,
it is naught more than a beast.

19:51.200 --> 19:54.880
So long as the blade of reason is my weapon,

19:55.180 --> 19:57.300
then we are not beasts,
but dragonmen!

19:57.950 --> 19:59.640
Could it be...

19:59.640 --> 20:01.670
You were controlling it?!

20:02.520 --> 20:05.140
O Will of the Labyrinth, I thank you.

20:05.460 --> 20:09.810
Even before divine power,
one could grasp one's own heart.

20:10.120 --> 20:12.920
Then I shall take on any god!

20:13.640 --> 20:16.790
You used the trial itself?

20:16.790 --> 20:19.500
Whether you could defy God's temptation...

20:20.160 --> 20:22.670
No, that is not all!

20:22.670 --> 20:25.260
You were trying to see
if you could deceive God!

20:25.620 --> 20:28.540
This trial was truly meaningful.

20:28.540 --> 20:31.410
But there is no lie in my words!

20:31.410 --> 20:35.050
Despite bearing such strong negative emotions...

20:35.050 --> 20:38.470
How... How can you possibly do that?!

20:38.470 --> 20:42.490
You shall not look down on me.

20:42.490 --> 20:46.070
For I am the descendant
of the proud dragonman family Klarus,

20:46.520 --> 20:48.350
Tio Klarus!

20:49.120 --> 20:51.610
Fangs of vengeance? How foolish.

20:51.610 --> 20:54.470
The real strongest fangs
are those of a dragon.

20:54.890 --> 20:58.020
Have a taste of their sharpness.

21:07.710 --> 21:08.960
Sorry.

21:09.410 --> 21:13.710
Even though it was according to plan,
I sure have made you worry.

21:14.170 --> 21:16.710
But I appreciate your support.

21:16.710 --> 21:18.330
Thank you.

21:19.020 --> 21:20.530
Don't mention it...

21:21.550 --> 21:24.270
Not at all.

21:24.680 --> 21:27.280
Are you the only ones
who have linked up?

21:27.280 --> 21:30.230
Yeah, we haven't seen the others yet.

